@1 = ~Vitriolic Sphere
(Evocation)

Level: 4
Range: Visual range of the caster
Duration: Special
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: 20-ft. radius
Saving Throw: Breath, half

A glowing emerald sphere streaks toward a chosen point and bursts into a shower of searing acid. All creatures within a 20-ft. radius, allies included, suffer 1d4 points of acid damage per level of the caster, up to a maximum of 12d4 (save vs. Breath for half).

Creatures that fail their save are drenched in acid and suffer 1d4 additional points of acid damage per 2 levels of the caster (maximum 6d4) on the following round. Creatures that succeed take no delayed damage.~
